      "body": "Play [Block Blast Unblocked](https://blockblastunblocked.app/), a fun match-3 puzzle game! Match blocks, create combos, and blast through levels. Play free on any device!\n\nlink：https://blockblastunblocked.app/\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/1f9b7eed-370f-45b8-aaab-321c4f77e9ab)\n\n### What is [Block Blast Unblocked](https://blockblastunblocked.app/)?\n\nBlock Blast Unblocked is the ultimate match-3 puzzle game designed to challenge your strategic thinking and quick reflexes. This engaging game allows players to match colorful blocks, create powerful combos, and blast through hundreds of exciting levels—all without the need for downloads. Enjoy the complete Block Blast experience directly in your browser, accessible anywhere!\n\n### Features of [Block Blast Unblocked](https://blockblastunblocked.app/)\n\n1. ### Addictive Gameplay: Connect three or more blocks of the same color to make them disappear and score points.\n2. ### Special Combinations: Create powerful boosters such as Line Blasters, Color Bombs, Star Blocks, and Rainbow Blocks to enhance your gameplay.\n3. ### Multiple Game Modes: Enjoy Classic Mode, Time Attack, Endless Mode, and Puzzle Mode, each offering unique challenges and objectives.\n4. ### Brain Training: Enhance cognitive skills through pattern recognition and strategic planning.\n5. ### Social Gaming: Compete with friends by comparing scores and achievements.\n\n### How to Play [Block Blast Unblocked](https://blockblastunblocked.app/)\nTo play Block Blast Unblocked, simply swipe or click and drag to swap adjacent blocks and create matches. The more blocks you match at once, the higher your score! Here are some key gameplay elements:\n\n- ### Game Basics: Connect three or more blocks of the same color to make them disappear.\n- ### Special Combinations:\n  - ### Line Blaster: Match 4 blocks in a row to clear an entire row or column.\n  - ### Color Bomb: Match 5 blocks to eliminate all blocks of the same color.\n  - ### Star Block: Match blocks in a T or L shape to create a 3×3 explosion.\n  - ### Rainbow Block: Combine special blocks for the ultimate power-up!\n\n![Image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dc631d28-4540-49bf-a78b-106d2ceaa860)",
